{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942470/extras/982ac6512f27a38337874e3637a5998d.avif?t=1768039798\" width=1600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942470/extras/d4f0898252fe84025638027e7c3a583e.avif?t=1768039798\" width=615 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking place twenty years after the Metagen-92 virus \u2013 aka the \u201cSuperflu\u201d \u2013 has swept the world and rendered many of its adult population superpowered or mutated, Origin Story follows a seemingly normal nineteen-year-old who in any other universe would be a popular and attractive prospect for most girls. But in this universe, his ability hasn't manifested yet. Shunned by most of his meta-gifted peers, he finds himself a hapless virgin on the lower rung of his college's social ladder, with only a few misfit friends by his side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When he is targeted and violently attacked for reasons unknown to him, The Sisterhood \u2013 a government-backed team of celebrity superheroines and sex icons - comes to his aid. While under their care, The Sisterhood immediately recognize his worth and hidden charms.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He soon finds himself juggling college life, his suddenly blossoming relationships with the women he keeps close, his curious involvement with The Sisterhood and one big secret that could determine whether this is the origin story of a hero, or a villain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Origin Story is a story-heavy visual novel that balances the funny, the sad, the absurd, and the erotic in a blend of superhero drama and slice-of-life college comedy. With a diverse cast of sweet, engaging, and beautiful characters, you\u2019ll never be without someone who piques your interest. Maybe you\u2019ll want all of them. Perhaps they'll want you to have all of them, too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942470/extras/a59697a63e7d3bcbcad08b34c87390ac.avif?t=1768039798\" width=615 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942470/extras/99b64f6bed117dddd01795dda19cda7a.avif?t=1768039798\" width=1600 height=781 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus many other interesting side girls and minor characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942470/extras/6d8fb9e51d1b55da61ba823cf277f6d8.avif?t=1768039798\" width=615 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season 1 contains the first 8 Chapters of Origin Story.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 7500 in-game renders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-specific galleries featuring hundreds of special renders that are unlocked as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >240,000 words</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10-12 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >173 Songs (including 3 made exclusively for Origin Story)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching narratives that are shaped by your decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scene replay gallery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3942470?t=1768039798","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3942470?t=1768